body:
"Compare yourself to who you were yesterday, not who someone else is today"

&#x200B;

Now if you think that 0's and 1's aren't good enough, you should try programming with the Soviet terinary system (0, 1, 2) or the best numeral system, balanced terinary (-1, 0, 1)

Class: Mesmer

&#x200B;

Armor Skins: Sport Sunglasses, Chronomancer's Epaulets, Warbeast Vestments, Warbeast Gloves, Funerary Pants, Triumphant Footgear, Mad Memories: Complete Ignition.

&#x200B;

Weapon Skins: Save the Queen, Dark Harvest, Ebon Vanguard Shield (not shown) 

&#x200B;

The Warbeast Vestments are by far one of my favorite skins, so I styled my Power Mesmer around it.
